  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/5FKz/32",
  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">동영상을 준비하는 아이들의 모습입니다. 1팀(3명)이 어제 저녁에 각자 내용정리를 해오기로 했지만.. 뭐 약속은 어기라고 있는 거죠 ㅎ</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">오늘 하루종일 조금씩 하면서 추가멤버가 붙었네요. 내용정리하고(교과서 베끼기 수준이지만ㅋ) 모여서 하나 해내는 게 즐거운 일이라는 걸 느끼는 놈들이 늘어나고 있습니다.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">말이 꼬일까봐 시나리오 작성하고, 친구한테 확인받고. 잘 가르쳐주고~ 사랑스런 것들 ㅋ</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">저는 핸드폰 들고 손가락만 톡톡 하려고 했으나 추임새도 넣고, 틀린 내용 때문에 '뭐라하노!'도 들어갔습니다.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">늦게 퇴근했지만, 굉장히 행복했습니다.</span><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">------------------------------------------------------------</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">아이들이 목소리가 들어간 동영상 편집을 하거나, 편집까지 한 걸 아이들이 올린 걸 보다보면</span></p><p><font color=\"#555555\" face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, Malgun Gothic, dotum, verdana, Trebuchet MS, Lucida Grande, Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, hiragino kaku gothic pro, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">'으~~ 내가 설명하고 싶다~'는 생각이 꾸역꾸역 올라옵니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#555555\" face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, Malgun Gothic, dotum, verdana, Trebuchet MS, Lucida Grande, Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, hiragino kaku gothic pro, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">저 부분에서 이 설명이 빠졌는데.. 저렇게 하면 더 잘 이해될텐데..&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#555555\" face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, Malgun Gothic, dotum, verdana, Trebuchet MS, Lucida Grande, Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, hiragino kaku gothic pro, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">그래도, 일단 믿고 버텨보려구요.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#555555\" face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, Malgun Gothic, dotum, verdana, Trebuchet MS, Lucida Grande, Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, hiragino kaku gothic pro, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">동영상에서 부족했던 부분은 활동지, 활동을 잘 짜서 극복해보고&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#555555\" face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, Malgun Gothic, dotum, verdana, Trebuchet MS, Lucida Grande, Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, hiragino kaku gothic pro, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">틀린 부분은 찾아내라 그러고..&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><br></p><p><font color=\"#555555\" face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, Malgun Gothic, dotum, verdana, Trebuchet MS, Lucida Grande, Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, hiragino kaku gothic pro, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">어제보다 나은 내일이 되면 되지 뭐. 이러고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#555555\" face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, Malgun Gothic, dotum, verdana, Trebuchet MS, Lucida Grande, Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, hiragino kaku gothic pro, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">저도, 아이들도 어제보다 나은 내일이 되고 있는 것 같습니다.</span></font></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><br></span></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/265C2D3A5418674812\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\" id=\"A_265C2D3A54186748125047\"></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/210390395418674814\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\" id=\"A_210390395418674814D3D9\"></p><p><iframe id=\"v7a3dwYwrJrbYr7eY5nYesk\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/v7a3dwYwrJrbYr7eY5nYesk?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InY3YTNkd1l3ckpyYllyN2VZNW5ZZXNrIiwidGlkIjoiMWQwYWZhYWItN2IxNC00YWRiLWE5MGQtMDc1ZGQxM2QyMGRjIiwiYX